**Day 159**: Added a panic-hook integration test that verifies when `FailureObserved` is recorded while a model call is in progress, the model call gets properly closed with "interrupted" status BEFORE the failure event is recorded. This prevents orphaned model calls that go unclosed when the harness panics.

